# Raw data - far over GitHub's 100 MiB per-file limit.
# Both partners download these from the sources listed in each README.
# NOTE: this excludes directory *contents* rather than the directories themselves,
# because git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
Datasets/*

!Datasets/Primary/
Datasets/Primary/*
!Datasets/Primary/README.md

!Datasets/Supplemental/
Datasets/Supplemental/*
!Datasets/Supplemental/README.md

# macOS cruft
.DS_Store
